/**
 * Durable artifact rows and payloads behind `ctx.artifacts`
 * ({@link ArtifactsApi}).
 *
 * Cursor-managed hosting preserves artifacts across deployment replacement.
 * Self-hosted agents store them under `--state-root/artifacts`.
 */
